    "Content": "<p>You can now develop functions using Python 3.10 locally and deploy them to all Azure Functions plans.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more information on newly supported features, see&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.10.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">What&rsquo;s New In Python 3.10.</a></p>\r\n",
